# Secrets and signing material. A CLI deployment uploads the project directory,
# and .gitignore does not apply here, so these must be listed explicitly or the
# service-role key, Resend key, admin session secret and signing keystore would
# travel to the build container. Production values come from Vercel env vars
# (scripts/sync-vercel-env.js), never from these files.
.env
.env.*
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pem
android/key.properties
android/local.properties
.demo-accounts.local.json
supabase/backups